      "statement": "dev:web refuses to start if LANGGRAPH_PORT (default 2024) or WEB_PORT (default 5173) answers on 127.0.0.1 or ::1, then runs langgraph dev and Vite (--strictPort, VITE_API_URL pointing at the langgraph port) both in the background, each in its own process group via set -m, plus an announcer that prints the UI/API/Studio URLs once /ok and /ui/ respond or fails after 2 minutes.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://mise.toml#L24-L73",
